***TRACCESS / LOCKBOX LOCATION: N/A;
***SITE HARDENED: Yes, all puck locks have a combo of 6713;
***ACCESS INSTRUCTIONS: DO NOT ACCESS SITE WITHOUT COORDINATING ACCESS WITH AMERICAN TOWER. OWNER OF PROPERTY HAS THREATENED LEGAL ACTION AGAINST ANYONE WHO COMES ON SITE WITHOUT PERMISSION. UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHOULD YOU DRIVE PAST THE SMALL PARKING LOT. DO NOT ATTEMPT TO DRIVE TOWARDS TOWER;
***HOW TO ACCESS ANTENNAS: Owner will not allow man lift on site. You must climb to access radios/antennas. Pegs are installed- work with American Tower to receive approval to climb;
***POC/MLA Tower: American Tower, ATC Site ID: 301293, 877-518-6937;
***POWER OUTAGE SOLUTION: Cam locks available but absolutely no PG deployment unless American Tower approves it with the owner;
***BACKHAUL: ATT 10G, Ciena next to PPC;
***POWER: LADWP 240v/200a, Meter Number: M9-1000548;

